'''Jaçurumi''' is one of the 67 [[Commune district|legislative districts]] in the [[Carpinchera]] [[regions of Balisca|region of Bayara]] (143). Like the other 735 Baliscan commune districts, it elects one [[Confederal Congress|delegate]] using the {{W|instant-runoff voting}} system.

